WEBVTT

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.020
Worked on the series:
Lily, Tiramisu, Zinger, Pineapple, Host, Marcus

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.020
How did I become

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.020
queen

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:03.920
FANSUB GROUP AZALIA PRESENTS

00:01:03.920 --> 00:01:06.290
All characters are fictitious

00:01:06.290 --> 00:01:09.090
and the events shown are fiction.

00:01:09.860 --> 00:01:12.230
Episode 6

00:01:12.230 --> 00:01:13.860
Exactly.

00:01:13.060 --> 02:01:37.060
AZALEA

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:18.630
In the tactics section "Notes on weapons and equipment"

00:01:18.630 --> 00:01:21.200
it is said that if there are fewer allies than enemies,

00:01:21.200 --> 00:01:23.270
you need to resort to retreat.

00:01:23.270 --> 00:01:27.770
If you are unable to defend, retreat and...

00:01:28.780 --> 00:01:31.010
What a strange woman.

00:01:32.050 --> 00:01:34.110
Your Majesty, you won't believe it.

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:36.620
He behaves extremely unusually.

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:41.990
How long can you dance to the ancient music of your ancestors?

00:01:41.990 --> 00:01:43.620
I

00:01:44.560 --> 00:01:47.260
served in special forces.

00:01:47.860 --> 00:01:50.300
- He talks so arrogantly.
-Attack.

00:01:50.300 --> 00:01:51.970
And you, I suppose, imagine yourself to be a king.

00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:53.870
I am the king.

00:01:56.240 --> 00:01:57.910
Thank you.

00:01:57.910 --> 00:02:00.870
Are you crazy?

00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:07.010
Forget it, I don't care.

00:02:07.080 --> 00:02:09.080
Get out.

00:02:09.080 --> 00:02:11.850
And she behaves like she's crazy.

00:02:19.960 --> 00:02:22.900
And sometimes as if she were Buddha.

00:02:22.900 --> 00:02:28.840
I ask you, do not touch those who are innocent of anything.

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:30.970
But she is angry as if evil spirits have possessed her.

00:02:30.970 --> 00:02:33.870
Anyone in my place would be angry right now,

00:02:33.870 --> 00:02:35.210
if he were not a Buddha.

00:02:35.210 --> 00:02:37.710
Sometimes she is the very embodiment of humanity,

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:40.750
and I don't understand what's on my mind
this mysterious woman.

00:02:41.650 --> 00:02:44.950
The moment has passed. There's no point in saying anything.

00:02:45.190 --> 00:02:47.390
Is there really no point?

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:51.520
Am I so difficult to explain?

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:56.830
-What did you say?
-You didn't listen to me.

00:02:56.830 --> 00:02:58.800
What were you thinking about?

00:02:58.800 --> 00:03:01.500
Have you forgotten about your favorite book?

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:05.410
It must be about Mrs. Hwajin.

00:03:06.310 --> 00:03:08.010
Not at all.

00:03:08.680 --> 00:03:09.910
No need to pretend.

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:14.820
You can see from your eyes that you were thinking about the woman.

00:03:14.820 --> 00:03:16.720
I thought about the queen.

00:03:16.720 --> 00:03:17.720
What?

00:03:17.720 --> 00:03:20.390
So stop being embarrassing
me in your own words.

00:03:20.820 --> 00:03:22.960
The queen is also a woman

00:03:22.960 --> 00:03:25.730
but I never thought of her in that way.

00:03:26.490 --> 00:03:28.330
You'll never guess what's on her mind

00:03:28.330 --> 00:03:31.130
no wonder you're interested.

00:03:33.100 --> 00:03:35.600
The Queen is the most unusual and strange person

00:03:35.600 --> 00:03:38.870
of everyone I know.

00:03:39.540 --> 00:03:43.440
It's like she's not from our world.

00:03:45.180 --> 00:03:49.350
And best describes our queen...

00:03:50.280 --> 00:03:52.320
Let me think.

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:57.120
A word that speaks directly
that a person is not of this world.

00:03:57.120 --> 00:03:58.860
Alien.

00:03:59.060 --> 00:04:01.330
-Alien?
-Yeah.

00:04:04.630 --> 00:04:06.730
It suits her perfectly.

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:09.840
Alien.

00:04:14.410 --> 00:04:16.810
Has the rain finally stopped?

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:19.150
It was raining all night.

00:04:19.150 --> 00:04:21.550
I hope no one was hurt.

00:04:21.550 --> 00:04:23.450
Me too.

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:25.850
I'm restless.

00:04:28.360 --> 00:04:31.390
How long are you going to talk so strangely?

00:04:31.390 --> 00:04:34.330
Only today. This is the last day.

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:39.530
And tomorrow everything will fall into place! Oh yes!

00:04:44.910 --> 00:04:46.540
Can't be!

00:04:55.280 --> 00:04:56.880
Your Majesty!

00:05:04.930 --> 00:05:08.030
Open the gate! King's order!

00:05:08.060 --> 00:05:10.260
-Open the gate!
-Open the gate!

00:05:32.290 --> 00:05:34.890
I shouldn't have gotten here
Jang Bong-hwan

00:07:10.680 --> 00:07:11.750
Are you okay?

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:13.420
Damn you!

00:07:13.550 --> 00:07:14.620
What are you doing?

00:07:14.620 --> 00:07:16.320
He recently tried to kill me!

00:07:16.320 --> 00:07:18.130
I have to ask you the same thing!

00:07:18.130 --> 00:07:20.260
I can't believe it
that you tried to commit suicide again!

00:07:20.260 --> 00:07:22.000
Are you crazy?

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:24.730
What do you care if I'm alive or not?

00:07:24.730 --> 00:07:27.130
Didn't you want me to die?

00:07:30.140 --> 00:07:33.240
So don't bother me! Get out!

00:07:33.910 --> 00:07:37.340
It's not too late to resolve all misunderstandings.

00:07:38.010 --> 00:07:40.380
Let's live the way you wanted.

00:07:41.480 --> 00:07:43.120
Social distancing.

00:07:47.850 --> 00:07:50.890
Right! Social distancing.

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:53.930
-No way!
- Get out!

00:07:53.930 --> 00:07:55.830
What are you doing! Let me go!

00:07:55.830 --> 00:07:57.500
You bastard!

00:07:58.500 --> 00:08:01.770
Said you want to keep your distance
Are you trying to die yourself?

00:08:02.870 --> 00:08:04.540
Didn't you try to kill me?

00:08:04.540 --> 00:08:05.910
So why the hell are you touching me?

00:08:05.910 --> 00:08:07.740
I understand why you're angry.

00:08:07.740 --> 00:08:11.640
I have committed a great sin and now
indebted to you.

00:08:11.750 --> 00:08:15.850
I know it sounds like an excuse
but we just misunderstood each other.

00:08:15.850 --> 00:08:19.320
I don’t care how we understood each other there.

00:08:19.320 --> 00:08:21.050
Please listen to me.

00:08:21.050 --> 00:08:23.560
I don’t want to listen to you pouring water into my ears!

00:08:23.690 --> 00:08:25.790
-Out of the way!
-No way!

00:08:25.930 --> 00:08:27.490
I agree to distance

00:08:27.490 --> 00:08:29.960
I will never leave you!

00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:34.600
Do you even understand what distancing means?

00:08:34.600 --> 00:08:36.200
Certainly.

00:08:37.040 --> 00:08:40.170
I remember everything you said.

00:08:40.710 --> 00:08:42.340
Social distancing.

00:08:43.040 --> 00:08:45.510
Live in peace and harmony.

00:08:46.510 --> 00:08:48.950
Live, my queen.

00:08:49.320 --> 00:08:51.520
Yes, you forgot the most important thing!

00:08:51.520 --> 00:08:52.690
Everyone for themselves!

00:08:52.690 --> 00:08:54.860
Live as you want
and I will live my own way!

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:56.720
The main thing in all this is not to live,

00:08:56.720 --> 00:08:59.530
but the fact that everyone is for himself!

00:08:59.530 --> 00:09:02.130
I will do my best to follow this rule!

00:09:02.130 --> 00:09:04.930
I will try my best to make it so
so that we both can be happy!

00:09:04.930 --> 00:09:07.970
Forget about him!
Forget about fucking distancing!

00:09:07.970 --> 00:09:09.140
Why?

00:09:09.140 --> 00:09:12.510
You and I put different meanings into this phrase!

00:09:12.510 --> 00:09:15.510
Such a small thing, but already two different meanings!

00:09:15.510 --> 00:09:17.010
We think alike.

00:09:17.010 --> 00:09:19.250
I'll prove it to you.

00:09:19.380 --> 00:09:22.150
I suggest sticking to social distancing.

00:09:22.150 --> 00:09:24.650
I won't stick to it!

00:09:24.650 --> 00:09:27.320
Let's try to live by this rule!

00:09:27.320 --> 00:09:29.660
You're annoying!

00:09:40.330 --> 00:09:43.870
Episode 6: Between Understanding and Misunderstanding

00:09:45.510 --> 00:09:47.610
-Your Majesty!
-Your Majesty!

00:09:49.110 --> 00:09:51.810
Your Majesty, what happened?

00:09:51.810 --> 00:09:53.510
Call the chief eunuch now.

00:09:53.510 --> 00:09:57.720
I'm fine, take care of the queen.

00:09:58.180 --> 00:10:00.320
-Yes, Your Majesty.
-Yes, Your Majesty.

00:10:01.520 --> 00:10:03.190
Oh, our poor you!

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:05.760
Faster!

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:17.340
I shouldn't have gotten here
Jang Bong-hwan

00:11:17.130 --> 00:11:19.100
I missed you.

00:11:19.370 --> 00:11:21.730
I missed you too.

00:11:23.900 --> 00:11:25.940
Are you in the room?

00:11:26.610 --> 00:11:28.310
Yes, father.

00:11:33.680 --> 00:11:36.250
I see you are already ready.

00:11:36.620 --> 00:11:38.720
How did you sleep?

00:11:38.720 --> 00:11:40.320
Well,

00:11:40.350 --> 00:11:44.090
today is your first day in the palace,
So I got up early.

00:11:44.090 --> 00:11:47.890
I'll try my best

00:11:47.890 --> 00:11:49.660
and I will not disgrace the name of the family.

00:11:49.660 --> 00:11:52.730
It's good that the rain has stopped
the road to the palace will be much easier.

00:11:52.730 --> 00:11:54.400
Finish getting ready.

00:11:54.400 --> 00:11:56.070
Yes.

00:12:17.690 --> 00:12:20.030
I almost choked

00:12:20.030 --> 00:12:23.030
honestly, if it weren't for Cheoljong,
I would already be dead.

00:12:23.030 --> 00:12:25.500
Why didn't this devil come back?

00:12:31.440 --> 00:12:34.270
What happened between you and the king?

00:12:34.270 --> 00:12:36.680
Why were you at the lake at such an hour?

00:12:39.810 --> 00:12:42.080
Are you still not finished?

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:45.420
I wiped everything off.

00:12:50.360 --> 00:12:54.390
When did you manage to escape?
I was watching you.

00:12:55.030 --> 00:12:58.800
Did you jump into the water again?

00:12:59.200 --> 00:13:01.770
It's not like that at all.

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:07.540
Your Majesty, I brought a change of clothes.

00:13:07.540 --> 00:13:09.440
Why are you so wet then?

00:13:09.440 --> 00:13:13.210
Yes so. I was glad that the lake was filled again,

00:13:13.210 --> 00:13:16.180
So I decided to go for a swim.

00:13:16.680 --> 00:13:18.220
What?

00:13:18.220 --> 00:13:20.450
Were you two swimming?

00:13:20.550 --> 00:13:22.520
You shouldn't do this!

00:13:22.520 --> 00:13:25.560
What if you get sick?

00:13:26.960 --> 00:13:31.000
It looks like the lake won't help me get back.

00:13:32.030 --> 00:13:33.730
Some kind of nonsense.

00:13:44.040 --> 00:13:45.710
Your Majesty!

00:13:46.110 --> 00:13:47.380
There you are!

00:13:47.380 --> 00:13:49.620
I've been looking for you everywhere

00:13:49.620 --> 00:13:51.920
Where were you in such a hurry...

00:13:52.490 --> 00:13:54.720
Why are you completely wet?

00:13:54.720 --> 00:13:57.290
-It's OK.
-How so?

00:14:46.010 --> 00:14:47.610
I am indebted to you forever,

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:50.780
Therefore, I will live to help you, madam.

00:14:59.190 --> 00:15:02.160
Sorry, I didn't notice you.

00:15:02.160 --> 00:15:04.690
Are you sure you didn't see anything?

00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:21.110
When the small fry knows too much

00:15:21.110 --> 00:15:22.980
Only death awaits her.

00:15:24.480 --> 00:15:27.850
This is the rule of the palace.

00:15:28.550 --> 00:15:31.050
I have to survive.

00:15:31.120 --> 00:15:34.820
Lady Hwajin told me to live.

00:15:59.710 --> 00:16:04.880
Today at dawn the queen fell into the lake again.

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:09.320
But this time the king was with her...

00:16:09.720 --> 00:16:14.560
It seems like no one knows
why they both ended up in the water.

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:17.630
That's enough

00:16:17.630 --> 00:16:22.300
to prove that I will be useful?

00:16:23.200 --> 00:16:25.910
Tell this to the Queen Mother.

00:16:26.240 --> 00:16:30.140
Should I describe everything exactly as it happened?

00:16:30.140 --> 00:16:32.380
After you talk,

00:16:32.680 --> 00:16:34.950
tell me everything you say or do

00:16:34.950 --> 00:16:37.180
Queen Mother, any little thing.

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:42.250
It's not up to you to decide what might be useful.

00:16:42.460 --> 00:16:44.290
I will do exactly as you ordered.

00:16:45.260 --> 00:16:48.030
From this day forward, you obey the lady of the court.

00:16:48.030 --> 00:16:51.000
the queen's chambers.

00:16:53.800 --> 00:16:55.500
Queen's chambers?

00:16:56.070 --> 00:16:58.300
This is a very high position!

00:16:58.340 --> 00:16:59.910
Thank you, sir!

00:16:59.910 --> 00:17:03.540
The Queen Mother will decide
that you will be much more useful to her.

00:17:04.340 --> 00:17:07.750
Pay close attention to the queen's surroundings.

00:17:08.110 --> 00:17:10.750
Yes, sir.

00:17:21.660 --> 00:17:23.400
Draw a flower

00:17:23.400 --> 00:17:25.460
or bud?

00:17:26.470 --> 00:17:28.770
What do you think, Ovol?

00:17:33.840 --> 00:17:36.040
Besides His Majesty,

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:38.540
I have no one now.

00:17:41.480 --> 00:17:45.280
Your Highness, the Queen Mother is here.

00:17:49.520 --> 00:17:51.720
Greetings, Your Majesty.

00:17:51.720 --> 00:17:54.230
You drew orchids.

00:18:00.570 --> 00:18:02.300
Are they finished?

00:18:02.300 --> 00:18:03.840
Not yet.

00:18:03.840 --> 00:18:07.270
I haven’t decided whether to draw a flower or an unopened bud.

00:18:07.270 --> 00:18:09.780
Let me see.

00:18:09.910 --> 00:18:13.580
I think the bud will do.

00:18:14.280 --> 00:18:16.980
Everyone will be interested

00:18:17.650 --> 00:18:21.520
what kind of flower will it be?

00:18:39.070 --> 00:18:42.010
God, what a beauty.

00:18:42.040 --> 00:18:44.910
I hope the buds don't fly around,

00:18:44.910 --> 00:18:48.150
not having time to bloom.

00:18:49.880 --> 00:18:51.120
By the way.

00:18:51.120 --> 00:18:54.650
I came to give you a small gift.

00:19:07.400 --> 00:19:08.700
Thank you.

00:19:08.700 --> 00:19:10.240
I didn't know what you liked

00:19:10.240 --> 00:19:12.840
I had to think for a long time.

00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:25.650
I heard that you are an excellent archer.

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:28.990
I also want to learn how to shoot a bow.

00:19:28.990 --> 00:19:31.820
I prepared it for myself and for you.

00:19:35.230 --> 00:19:37.730
Beautiful and durable arrows.

00:19:39.170 --> 00:19:40.400
Thank you.

00:19:40.400 --> 00:19:43.600
The real gift is not arrows.

00:19:44.270 --> 00:19:47.370
The gift will be delivered today

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:50.180
To His Majesty for a meeting of the court.

00:19:58.420 --> 00:19:59.990
Where if not in the lake?

00:19:59.990 --> 00:20:02.350
Only water unites us.

00:20:08.060 --> 00:20:09.900
And one more thing.

00:20:10.460 --> 00:20:12.730
We were both on the verge of death.

00:20:13.000 --> 00:20:15.070
Damn, what if I try and really die?

00:20:15.070 --> 00:20:17.440
Dying hurts so much.

00:20:18.740 --> 00:20:22.570
I'm sure there is a safe way to return.

00:20:23.140 --> 00:20:25.840
First, I’ll understand what kind of woman this is.

00:20:29.350 --> 00:20:32.380
I'm Kim Soyeon.

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:35.390
She committed suicide.

00:20:35.960 --> 00:20:40.890
Leave your false self?

00:20:41.890 --> 00:20:45.030
Why did you try to die? I didn't want to live.

00:20:47.230 --> 00:20:50.140
Of course, that's why she doesn't want to come back.

00:20:50.340 --> 00:20:53.910
This woman... She ran away?

00:20:57.940 --> 00:21:00.210
I understand why you do this.

00:21:00.210 --> 00:21:02.320
Are you obsessed with the lake?

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:04.680
and mutter to yourself.

00:21:04.750 --> 00:21:06.850
It's because you...

00:21:10.190 --> 00:21:12.760
trying to bring back memories?

00:21:14.760 --> 00:21:16.760
Yes. You're right.

00:21:16.760 --> 00:21:18.160
Fine.

00:21:18.160 --> 00:21:20.700
A question has arisen. When I fell into the lake

00:21:20.700 --> 00:21:23.470
They immediately pulled me out, but I was unconscious?

00:21:24.040 --> 00:21:25.570
Yes.

00:21:25.570 --> 00:21:27.610
Crap. I knew it. She ran away.

00:21:28.040 --> 00:21:30.080
It's not fair.

00:21:30.080 --> 00:21:32.410
I want to go back.

00:21:33.580 --> 00:21:35.780
This is a kidnapping!

00:21:36.650 --> 00:21:39.350
Fried dorosoma brings back runaway wives.

00:21:39.820 --> 00:21:42.790
Or summon spirits that have left the body?

00:21:43.290 --> 00:21:44.890
Ritual?

00:21:45.260 --> 00:21:48.430
Yes. I have to perform the ceremony.

00:21:48.430 --> 00:21:50.860
I'll cover everything here with expensive talismans.

00:21:51.600 --> 00:21:54.030
Court Lady Choi, are you there?

00:21:58.270 --> 00:22:02.340
Is there an expert on rituals or talismans here?

00:22:02.910 --> 00:22:04.510
What?

00:22:04.510 --> 00:22:07.480
You shouldn't be interested in shamanism,

00:22:08.110 --> 00:22:10.480
but you'll do it anyway?

00:22:12.120 --> 00:22:16.490
One person comes to mind.

00:22:17.190 --> 00:22:18.820
And who?

00:22:27.630 --> 00:22:31.200
Why did she come here? What does he want to know?

00:22:31.200 --> 00:22:34.540
To what do I owe this pleasure?

00:22:35.240 --> 00:22:37.410
I found out that you are an expert.

00:22:37.540 --> 00:22:40.650
I? What?

00:22:41.110 --> 00:22:44.350
I need a spiritual guide.

00:22:44.650 --> 00:22:48.220
In matters such as rituals and talismans.

00:22:48.220 --> 00:22:51.590
Did you really guess that I have a new talisman,

00:22:51.590 --> 00:22:53.660
cursing her?

00:22:54.030 --> 00:22:57.130
Come on, this is bad taste.

00:22:57.130 --> 00:23:00.330
Why do you need this?

00:23:00.330 --> 00:23:02.100
Yes, that's nonsense.

00:23:02.100 --> 00:23:06.240
It is necessary to summon the spirit that has left the body.

00:23:07.440 --> 00:23:09.440
Does this happen often?

00:23:09.440 --> 00:23:12.980
She cleverly tries to get closer to me.

00:23:12.980 --> 00:23:15.980
Wants to punish me for my talismans.

00:23:15.980 --> 00:23:18.020
Sly fox.

00:23:18.550 --> 00:23:21.620
I don't believe in such things.

00:23:21.620 --> 00:23:24.760
Neither ghosts nor spirits.

00:23:26.190 --> 00:23:30.460
Then what is this here for?

00:23:37.500 --> 00:23:39.170
You're wrong.

00:23:39.170 --> 00:23:41.470
This is not a shamanic place.

00:23:41.470 --> 00:23:44.210
Here I cleanse my soul.

00:23:44.210 --> 00:23:46.140
It's clear.

00:23:48.380 --> 00:23:50.020
What?

00:23:50.250 --> 00:23:51.950
Is it true?

00:23:52.720 --> 00:23:57.560
Whose spirit do you want to call upon?

00:23:58.860 --> 00:24:03.160
I can say that we are close and closely connected.

00:24:04.630 --> 00:24:06.200
This is a woman, don't get me wrong.

00:24:06.200 --> 00:24:07.930
Clear.

00:24:08.370 --> 00:24:12.840
This is probably your mother
which you have never seen.

00:24:14.240 --> 00:24:18.510
God. My heart is breaking for you.

00:24:18.610 --> 00:24:20.610
You must be lonely in the palace.

00:24:20.610 --> 00:24:23.320
You miss your late mother.

00:24:23.320 --> 00:24:25.020
Because of this

00:24:25.350 --> 00:24:28.020
tried to commit suicide?

00:24:30.160 --> 00:24:31.860
Do you think so?

00:24:31.860 --> 00:24:34.960
You can tell me everything.

00:24:34.960 --> 00:24:37.330
Although I did not give birth to a king,

00:24:37.330 --> 00:24:41.000
but according to the pedigree, I am his mother.

00:24:41.000 --> 00:24:46.370
From this day on, I will cherish you as my daughter and take care...

00:24:46.970 --> 00:24:49.370
I already have two mothers.

00:24:50.310 --> 00:24:53.710
The truth is, I wasn't trying to kill myself.

00:24:53.710 --> 00:24:57.320
Then why did you say that?

00:24:57.380 --> 00:24:59.050
And I mean the same thing.

00:24:59.050 --> 00:25:01.190
Why on earth did I do this?

00:25:01.320 --> 00:25:03.860
Do you want me to guess?

00:25:04.390 --> 00:25:07.590
So she has an ulterior motive.

00:25:09.330 --> 00:25:13.670
So she threatens me and wants
so that I'm on my guard.

00:25:18.940 --> 00:25:22.340
Crap. Wasted my time.

00:25:24.310 --> 00:25:26.710
The court meeting has not yet taken place.

00:25:26.710 --> 00:25:30.050
Is she already trying to threaten me?

00:25:30.920 --> 00:25:34.190
Court lady Han, they also have

00:25:34.190 --> 00:25:36.960
a bird that brings rumors.

00:25:36.960 --> 00:25:40.530
What? Who could have done this?

00:25:40.590 --> 00:25:45.930
She boldly burst in and dropped hints,

00:25:46.470 --> 00:25:50.670
This means that the bird cannot be identified so easily.

00:25:51.670 --> 00:25:54.040
Contact the fortune teller, Court Lady Han.

00:25:54.340 --> 00:25:59.080
I need predictions.

00:26:02.650 --> 00:26:05.250
Something was tormenting her and she tried to kill herself.

00:26:05.250 --> 00:26:06.950
But she couldn't die.

00:26:06.950 --> 00:26:09.050
And her soul is like, “Whatever. I’m going out.”

00:26:09.220 --> 00:26:12.660
And she didn’t return.

00:26:12.990 --> 00:26:14.690
What was tormenting her?

00:26:14.690 --> 00:26:17.100
She didn't want to become queen.

00:26:17.100 --> 00:26:18.760
Why?

00:26:19.230 --> 00:26:22.000
Because Cheoljong didn't love her

00:26:22.000 --> 00:26:24.570
and fell in love with someone else?

00:26:24.570 --> 00:26:26.140
Come on.

00:26:26.140 --> 00:26:28.840
Tried to die because of an asshole?

00:26:30.210 --> 00:26:33.350
Her Majesty talks to herself more than usual.

00:26:33.350 --> 00:26:34.910
Many people hear.

00:26:34.910 --> 00:26:36.820
That's the least of my problems.

00:26:36.820 --> 00:26:40.420
I nag her about it, but it's time to let it go.

00:26:41.190 --> 00:26:43.560
At this rate, she'll soon kill someone.

00:26:45.060 --> 00:26:47.590
But again, I understand her.

00:26:47.590 --> 00:26:50.660
Being a queen is like being in a prison without bars.

00:26:50.660 --> 00:26:53.800
From a noble family, chosen to become queen,

00:26:53.800 --> 00:26:56.240
That means she wasn't dating anyone.

00:26:56.240 --> 00:26:59.240
Perhaps she had never seen the guy before Cheoljong.

00:26:59.240 --> 00:27:01.770
Considering he's a king and all,

00:27:01.770 --> 00:27:04.240
It’s clear why she fell in love.

00:27:05.810 --> 00:27:10.150
Wait a minute. She must be having a lot of fun right now.

00:27:10.150 --> 00:27:12.520
Leading an ascetic lifestyle all my life,

00:27:12.520 --> 00:27:15.290
discovered a new world for myself.

00:27:17.920 --> 00:27:19.820
What if this woman...

00:27:20.690 --> 00:27:23.560
Let him not play with my body!

00:27:37.440 --> 00:27:39.180
What?

00:27:55.860 --> 00:27:57.760
Stand!

00:27:57.760 --> 00:28:00.800
Come back quickly, we'll teach you a lesson!

00:28:00.800 --> 00:28:02.370
Don't you want to?

00:28:02.370 --> 00:28:05.840
What are you looking at that’s so interesting?

00:28:06.340 --> 00:28:08.810
Then I will

00:28:09.140 --> 00:28:11.840
cut your body. Until I bleed!

00:28:11.840 --> 00:28:13.750
It will be very painful.

00:28:14.310 --> 00:28:18.820
Do you think I can't? I can do it. Like this!

00:28:25.220 --> 00:28:26.960
Damn, it hurts.

00:28:29.700 --> 00:28:32.660
This time there will definitely be blood.

00:28:37.100 --> 00:28:38.940
-Your Majesty!
-Your Majesty!

00:28:39.270 --> 00:28:41.040
It really hurts!

00:28:41.510 --> 00:28:43.440
-It hurts a lot.
-Get up.

00:28:44.580 --> 00:28:46.550
Hurt.

00:28:46.550 --> 00:28:49.450
-God.
-The cup of patience is full.

00:28:50.280 --> 00:28:54.150
Will return, will not return.

00:28:54.390 --> 00:28:55.990
Will return.

00:28:57.690 --> 00:28:59.390
Won't come back.

00:29:03.730 --> 00:29:05.430
More?

00:29:05.930 --> 00:29:07.770
Your Majesty, don't worry.

00:29:07.770 --> 00:29:10.340
Will return when the time is right.

00:29:10.340 --> 00:29:14.410
By then I will already be...

00:29:20.350 --> 00:29:23.520
I summon the spirit. Spirit come.

00:29:23.580 --> 00:29:25.920
Are you here?

00:29:26.920 --> 00:29:30.760
I call upon the spirit. Spirit come.

00:29:30.820 --> 00:29:32.990
Are you here?

00:29:34.790 --> 00:29:37.130
Since we have each other's bodies,

00:29:37.230 --> 00:29:40.230
let's talk frankly.

00:29:43.570 --> 00:29:45.840
Talking to yourself again?

00:29:46.670 --> 00:29:49.070
Consider it a self-exorcism

00:29:49.780 --> 00:29:51.610
or talking to yourself.

00:29:51.610 --> 00:29:53.480
What if rumors spread?

00:29:53.480 --> 00:29:56.280
In the palace they quickly fly away.

00:29:56.280 --> 00:29:58.780
What is this? Looks beautiful.

00:29:58.780 --> 00:30:01.490
His Majesty gave it to you.

00:30:01.490 --> 00:30:03.290
And I brought it.

00:30:12.930 --> 00:30:14.570
Book of Changes

00:30:15.630 --> 00:30:17.370
There's something inside.

00:30:18.000 --> 00:30:19.070
Social distancing

00:30:19.070 --> 00:30:22.570
God! So cute.

00:30:23.180 --> 00:30:25.210
Got it with this distance.

00:30:25.210 --> 00:30:28.650
I offered it to him, he refused. Now what?

00:30:34.120 --> 00:30:36.050
Do you still have a cold?

00:30:36.050 --> 00:30:37.660
I knew this would happen.

00:30:37.660 --> 00:30:40.390
You got wet in the rain and were still playing in the water.

00:30:40.390 --> 00:30:43.190
What do you want me to do with you?

00:30:45.300 --> 00:30:46.970
Hongyeon.

00:30:48.200 --> 00:30:50.100
It's not a cold.

00:30:50.100 --> 00:30:51.400
What then?

00:30:51.400 --> 00:30:53.270
This

00:30:54.870 --> 00:30:57.110
hopelessness itself.

00:30:57.940 --> 00:31:00.980
I thought that everything would get better when the lake was filled.

00:31:01.350 --> 00:31:05.720
But you see, hope is a cruel thing.

00:31:06.990 --> 00:31:10.260
To regain your memory, you are even ready to go to shamans.

00:31:10.820 --> 00:31:13.960
I hope you stop trying.

00:31:14.090 --> 00:31:16.460
If everything was fine with you,

00:31:16.460 --> 00:31:19.200
you wouldn't try to commit suicide.

00:31:19.600 --> 00:31:21.200
For your happiness,

00:31:21.200 --> 00:31:22.770
maybe it's better not to try to return...

00:31:22.770 --> 00:31:25.870
No! I have to!

00:31:27.210 --> 00:31:29.870
I can't live like this anymore.

00:31:32.010 --> 00:31:35.010
I'll tell the royal chef to prepare something for the cold.

00:31:35.010 --> 00:31:37.250
You need to eat and rest.

00:31:37.680 --> 00:31:40.520
No, this woman

00:31:40.520 --> 00:31:44.360
she will want to return. I give you my teeth.

00:31:48.190 --> 00:31:50.400
Here, blow your nose.

00:31:50.400 --> 00:31:53.430
I’m not a child, I can do it myself.

00:31:56.370 --> 00:31:59.270
One more time.

00:32:04.510 --> 00:32:06.380
-Eunuch Chha.
-Yes.

00:32:07.910 --> 00:32:12.620
Your Majesty, you have a cold. Please return to your chambers.

00:32:12.620 --> 00:32:14.820
No, it's not a cold.

00:32:14.820 --> 00:32:16.790
This...

00:32:19.790 --> 00:32:22.960
I think it's a cold. You were right.

00:32:23.530 --> 00:32:25.830
Have you heard from Daejojeon Hall?

00:32:25.830 --> 00:32:28.930
-No.
-Did she get the book?

00:32:28.930 --> 00:32:30.970
Yes, I received it.

00:32:31.600 --> 00:32:35.070
Of course, it is not easy to open a closed heart.

00:32:35.070 --> 00:32:37.610
I have a favor to ask of you.

00:32:37.610 --> 00:32:40.280
Get me something valuable.

00:32:42.480 --> 00:32:45.020
By "something valuable" you mean...

00:32:46.550 --> 00:32:49.320
What are you thinking about?

00:32:54.590 --> 00:32:56.700
We appoint Kim Byonin

00:32:56.700 --> 00:32:59.360
head of the Detective Department.

00:32:59.460 --> 00:33:01.330
Successful work.

00:33:02.430 --> 00:33:05.000
Thank you, Your Majesty.

00:33:12.580 --> 00:33:15.550
I heard that you are the youngest person to pass the state exam,

00:33:15.550 --> 00:33:17.750
They are also strong in martial arts.

00:33:18.380 --> 00:33:20.490
But despite this,

00:33:20.490 --> 00:33:22.350
you refused a government post,

00:33:22.350 --> 00:33:24.960
which caused general confusion.

00:33:24.960 --> 00:33:28.760
What made you change your mind?

00:33:29.730 --> 00:33:31.800
"Save the country in difficult times."

00:33:31.800 --> 00:33:34.630
During this difficult time I want to help

00:33:34.630 --> 00:33:37.370
with the restoration of order in the country.

00:33:41.470 --> 00:33:43.310
Difficult time?

00:33:43.580 --> 00:33:46.610
How is it possible that the ministers hid this from me,

00:33:46.610 --> 00:33:48.150
so that I don't worry.

00:33:48.150 --> 00:33:51.080
Who is this? Qing or Japanese?

00:33:51.080 --> 00:33:54.220
Difficulties within the country

00:33:54.250 --> 00:33:56.890
much more dangerous than external threats.

00:33:59.290 --> 00:34:02.330
Have we suddenly encountered difficulties within the country?

00:34:02.330 --> 00:34:04.560
This means...

00:34:14.010 --> 00:34:17.880
I caught a cold.

00:34:17.880 --> 00:34:22.650
A wise king should know how to take care of his health.

00:34:34.890 --> 00:34:36.330
You need to eat

00:34:36.330 --> 00:34:38.200
and then relax.

00:34:38.200 --> 00:34:41.200
I don't want to, I'll sit here
until I finally get sick.

00:34:41.200 --> 00:34:42.800
Let the body suffer.

00:34:43.100 --> 00:34:44.500
Still not mine.

00:34:44.500 --> 00:34:47.540
Let him be cold and hungry.

00:34:48.540 --> 00:34:50.640
I want more.

00:34:55.480 --> 00:34:56.920
Your Majesty,

00:34:56.920 --> 00:34:59.680
Torturing your body will not bring back your memory.

00:34:59.680 --> 00:35:01.790
You will only hurt yourself.

00:35:01.790 --> 00:35:04.360
You say this is not your body

00:35:04.360 --> 00:35:07.190
but it’s yours, even though you don’t remember anything.

00:35:07.190 --> 00:35:10.530
Who will suffer? You, of course.

00:35:11.300 --> 00:35:13.130
Even without memories

00:35:13.130 --> 00:35:15.700
you will definitely be happy.

00:35:15.700 --> 00:35:19.400
Look at the sky. What good weather today!

00:35:23.380 --> 00:35:26.910
Yes. There is no dust in the air.

00:35:30.120 --> 00:35:33.690
The breeze carries the smell of fresh manure.

00:35:34.520 --> 00:35:36.920
Korean food three times a day.

00:35:37.920 --> 00:35:39.460
How can you not be happy?

00:35:39.460 --> 00:35:41.730
Yes, I'm definitely happy.

00:35:42.730 --> 00:35:44.730
I agree with you.

00:35:47.570 --> 00:35:50.500
Your Majesty, are you crying?

00:35:50.500 --> 00:35:53.570
No, I'm not crying. I'm so happy.

00:35:53.710 --> 00:35:54.970
Just like you said

00:35:54.970 --> 00:35:57.680
I will try to live a happy life.

00:35:58.340 --> 00:36:02.410
Does the lack of memories make you so sad?

00:36:08.090 --> 00:36:11.120
We are concerned about the queen's condition.

00:36:11.120 --> 00:36:13.930
Therefore, we ask you to consider

00:36:13.930 --> 00:36:16.230
our appeal.

00:36:16.230 --> 00:36:17.800
What is this?

00:36:17.800 --> 00:36:20.730
Have you discussed the overthrow of the queen?

00:36:21.300 --> 00:36:22.730
-What?
-What?

00:36:22.730 --> 00:36:26.640
The Queen keeps trying to commit suicide

00:36:26.640 --> 00:36:30.010
and we need to strengthen the position of the inner courtyard.

00:36:31.210 --> 00:36:34.350
Consider deposing the queen.

00:36:34.880 --> 00:36:39.250
The queen lied to protect

00:36:39.250 --> 00:36:41.720
concubine Cho.

00:36:41.720 --> 00:36:44.290
After falling into the lake, she lost her mind.

00:36:44.290 --> 00:36:46.290
She thinks she is someone else.

00:36:46.290 --> 00:36:48.630
And at the sight of water he tries to commit suicide.

00:36:48.630 --> 00:36:50.630
The rumors are already out!

00:36:50.630 --> 00:36:52.800
If rumors are to be believed,

00:36:52.800 --> 00:36:54.770
then the words that concubine Cho

00:36:54.770 --> 00:36:57.800
pushed the queen, must also be true.

00:36:57.800 --> 00:36:59.070
What?

00:36:59.070 --> 00:37:01.210
- How dare you? - You.

00:37:01.410 --> 00:37:03.470
Quiet!

00:37:04.580 --> 00:37:08.980
I will reject the application for violation of the filing procedure.

00:37:08.980 --> 00:37:11.350
You must go with him to Seungjeongwon first.

00:37:11.350 --> 00:37:14.420
However, I am like the queen's husband

00:37:14.420 --> 00:37:16.690
and the person closest to her,

00:37:17.690 --> 00:37:20.660
I say her mind is fine.

00:37:22.330 --> 00:37:24.960
-And yet...
-We need to calm down.

00:37:24.960 --> 00:37:28.730
Let us conclude today's meeting.

00:37:30.340 --> 00:37:32.070
I allow it.

00:37:33.100 --> 00:37:34.710
Your Majesty.

00:37:38.510 --> 00:37:40.310
What brings you here?

00:37:40.310 --> 00:37:42.610
I heard that you are here.

00:37:43.980 --> 00:37:47.020
Have you heard the news?

00:37:48.170 --> 00:37:50.470
The king is coming!

00:37:51.290 --> 00:37:52.920
My queen.

00:37:56.060 --> 00:37:57.330
You are already here.

00:37:57.330 --> 00:37:59.460
Only you are late here.

00:37:59.460 --> 00:38:01.670
I thought, it seemed to me

00:38:01.670 --> 00:38:03.070
but the head of the Detective Department

00:38:03.070 --> 00:38:05.100
and really not happy with me.

00:38:05.970 --> 00:38:07.010
Head of the Detective Department?

00:38:07.010 --> 00:38:10.410
You turned your back on the queen and humiliated her

00:38:10.410 --> 00:38:13.410
who saved your beloved.

00:38:13.510 --> 00:38:17.210
I can imagine how you treated the queen all this time.

00:38:17.580 --> 00:38:20.220
Perhaps that's why she tried to commit suicide.

00:38:22.650 --> 00:38:24.390
Don't look at me.

00:38:24.820 --> 00:38:26.990
The Queen is in a quandary

00:38:26.990 --> 00:38:29.430
because I tried to save your concubine.

00:38:29.430 --> 00:38:31.760
-What will you do?
-What?

00:38:31.760 --> 00:38:34.300
I'll help her deal with this.

00:38:34.300 --> 00:38:38.300
How? What can you do?

00:38:41.510 --> 00:38:43.210
Are you asking now

00:38:43.210 --> 00:38:45.680
like the queen's brother

00:38:45.680 --> 00:38:48.280
or as the adopted son of Kim Jwageun?

00:38:48.280 --> 00:38:51.050
You don't have the strength to protect her.

00:38:51.050 --> 00:38:53.720
I say what I see.

00:38:54.520 --> 00:38:56.390
No power?

00:38:58.860 --> 00:39:00.620
That's true.

00:39:01.230 --> 00:39:05.300
However, I don't need strength against the strong.

00:39:05.300 --> 00:39:08.400
There is a more peaceful way.

00:39:08.500 --> 00:39:11.400
I just need to be obedient.

00:39:11.400 --> 00:39:13.700
To protect the queen

00:39:14.440 --> 00:39:16.670
I will be obedient.

00:39:16.910 --> 00:39:18.880
There is no need for this.

00:39:18.880 --> 00:39:21.610
I will protect the queen myself.

00:39:23.980 --> 00:39:27.020
I will stop the strong with more force.

00:39:35.830 --> 00:39:37.300
There you go.

00:39:37.300 --> 00:39:39.000
What's going on here?

00:39:39.000 --> 00:39:40.400
I see this is my problem.

00:39:40.400 --> 00:39:41.830
Why do you need to quarrel?

00:39:41.830 --> 00:39:44.870
What's happened? What's there?

00:39:44.870 --> 00:39:48.170
I have received an appeal for your overthrow.

00:39:49.470 --> 00:39:52.540
How so? I just decided to love this place.

00:39:52.540 --> 00:39:53.750
They wanted to kill

00:39:53.750 --> 00:39:55.950
and now everyone is eager to overthrow.

00:39:56.050 --> 00:39:58.420
Someone wanted to overthrow you?

00:39:58.880 --> 00:40:01.350
The Queen Dowager was angry with me.

00:40:02.020 --> 00:40:04.490
I'll talk to her.

00:40:04.820 --> 00:40:07.060
Actually, I know how to handle this.

00:40:08.160 --> 00:40:11.830
How come, apparently you also caught a cold.

00:40:16.170 --> 00:40:17.900
You too?

00:40:19.000 --> 00:40:20.840
Even though it's urgent,

00:40:20.840 --> 00:40:23.970
you need to go back and rest.

00:40:25.080 --> 00:40:28.480
If you've said everything you wanted, you can go.

00:40:28.550 --> 00:40:30.850
We need to discuss personal matters.

00:40:31.080 --> 00:40:34.490
I have something to tell you, so I'll wait.

00:40:36.220 --> 00:40:39.120
-I'll come again.
-Yeah.

00:40:47.530 --> 00:40:49.930
I wanted to wait for your answer,

00:40:49.930 --> 00:40:51.900
but there is no time.

00:40:51.940 --> 00:40:55.610
From now on I will follow the distancing rule.

00:40:55.610 --> 00:40:57.780
Why are you suddenly talking about this?

00:40:57.780 --> 00:41:00.610
If you don't want to, I'll be the one to follow it.

00:41:00.750 --> 00:41:02.350
Distance yourself.

00:41:02.750 --> 00:41:04.620
You got it all wrong.

00:41:04.620 --> 00:41:07.380
-Give me your hand.
-For what?

00:41:07.920 --> 00:41:09.690
What are you doing?

00:41:24.100 --> 00:41:25.900
My life

00:41:26.200 --> 00:41:29.740
has always been in the hands of your family.

00:41:30.680 --> 00:41:32.980
Apparently it blinded me.

00:41:34.210 --> 00:41:38.380
And I couldn't see that you
an innocent woman who

00:41:38.450 --> 00:41:40.850
tries his best.

00:41:42.090 --> 00:41:44.150
Sorry it's so late.

00:41:45.190 --> 00:41:47.760
Give me one more chance.

00:41:48.890 --> 00:41:51.030
A chance to understand you

00:41:51.230 --> 00:41:55.630
as an individual without any prejudices.

00:41:59.340 --> 00:42:01.040
You don't need to do this.

00:42:01.040 --> 00:42:03.140
I know you don't like showing off.

00:42:03.210 --> 00:42:06.780
But I must sincerely apologize at least once.

00:42:06.780 --> 00:42:07.980
Do as you please.

00:42:07.980 --> 00:42:09.980
Fine. That's what we'll do. Distancing.

00:42:09.980 --> 00:42:12.150
I have nothing left to lose.

00:42:15.590 --> 00:42:19.060
Then today is our first day.

00:42:19.360 --> 00:42:20.390
What?

00:42:20.390 --> 00:42:22.690
First day of distancing.

00:42:23.130 --> 00:42:25.430
Don't say that.

00:42:25.430 --> 00:42:28.270
-Why?
-Just don't say that. Don't you dare.

00:42:28.470 --> 00:42:30.570
What did I say wrong?

00:42:30.570 --> 00:42:31.840
Today is our first day.

00:42:31.840 --> 00:42:34.740
Yours She told me not to talk!

00:42:35.810 --> 00:42:38.210
But I just said, today is our...

00:42:38.210 --> 00:42:40.440
Stop it!

00:42:40.980 --> 00:42:43.280
I bet you know what that means, right?

00:42:43.280 --> 00:42:45.320
But today is our first...

00:42:45.320 --> 00:42:47.520
Stop it. How disgusting!

00:42:47.520 --> 00:42:48.850
-But this is our first day.
-Stop already.

00:42:48.850 --> 00:42:50.920
-Our...
-Stop it.

00:42:52.290 --> 00:42:54.960
Then, now that we've got that out of the way,

00:42:55.230 --> 00:42:58.000
I will do anything to protect you.

00:42:58.000 --> 00:43:00.670
Oh, that's right. There's no time to idle.

00:43:00.670 --> 00:43:02.400
Bye.

00:43:03.030 --> 00:43:05.840
Stop. Don't run like that. Don't run.

00:43:07.070 --> 00:43:08.770
So you can get hurt.

00:43:22.550 --> 00:43:24.360
Speak up.

00:43:24.360 --> 00:43:28.730
If the queen is unhappy, then you will be too.

00:43:28.960 --> 00:43:31.930
-Is this a threat?
-Only my concern.

00:43:33.200 --> 00:43:37.800
You are just her brother, but you are too protective.

00:43:37.800 --> 00:43:40.800
You are too indifferent, Your Majesty.

00:43:41.310 --> 00:43:44.240
I know I don't have much power

00:43:44.310 --> 00:43:46.510
but some decency must be observed.

00:43:46.510 --> 00:43:49.150
If you cross the line again

00:43:49.150 --> 00:43:52.150
I will raise a question about your behavior.

00:43:53.320 --> 00:43:55.450
Come on.

00:43:57.360 --> 00:43:59.520
I'll make you write

00:44:00.860 --> 00:44:03.430
a very long letter of apology.

00:44:05.560 --> 00:44:08.330
It's just long.

00:44:08.830 --> 00:44:11.300
You may have to stay up all night.

00:44:12.100 --> 00:44:14.470
And your fingers will hurt.

00:44:28.590 --> 00:44:31.520
Do they really believe that she can be deposed?

00:44:31.520 --> 00:44:33.090
Because of a simple request?

00:44:33.090 --> 00:44:36.630
They are trying to accumulate power through this.

00:44:37.260 --> 00:44:39.730
They will gather those who do not like our kind,

00:44:39.730 --> 00:44:42.530
and increase the number of requests. Everything is obvious.

00:44:42.530 --> 00:44:46.400
How dare they make their move so recklessly?

00:44:46.400 --> 00:44:48.740
We had to go through this at least once.

00:44:48.740 --> 00:44:50.840
Your Majesty,

00:44:50.840 --> 00:44:53.540
the queen has arrived.

00:44:54.980 --> 00:44:56.710
Let me in.

00:45:16.170 --> 00:45:20.600
I sincerely apologize for disturbing you.

00:45:22.710 --> 00:45:26.580
I deserved to be stripped of my title.

00:45:27.480 --> 00:45:29.780
But even if so,

00:45:29.910 --> 00:45:32.650
this must be done by the Queen Dowager.

00:45:32.650 --> 00:45:37.290
It is not right for someone from the Cho family to do this.

00:45:38.990 --> 00:45:41.290
No matter what kind of fool you are, no one will tolerate it

00:45:41.290 --> 00:45:43.890
to his subordinates
someone else was in charge.

00:45:43.900 --> 00:45:45.660
It's a matter of pride.

00:45:45.660 --> 00:45:48.530
If someone from the Cho family strips me of my title,

00:45:48.530 --> 00:45:50.840
it won't be my defeat

00:45:50.840 --> 00:45:53.540
it will be a defeat for the Kim family.

00:45:54.410 --> 00:45:56.410
If you already understand this,

00:45:56.410 --> 00:45:58.380
How could I do what I need to be responsible for?

00:45:58.380 --> 00:46:00.610
They rely on rumors.

00:46:00.610 --> 00:46:02.080
I'll take care of it.

00:46:02.080 --> 00:46:03.110
And how?

00:46:03.110 --> 00:46:04.650
The crisis is our chance.

00:46:04.650 --> 00:46:07.250
If you give me some time,
I'll use it

00:46:07.250 --> 00:46:10.320
to change your reputation.

00:46:20.230 --> 00:46:22.830
Today the king took your side,

00:46:22.830 --> 00:46:25.700
when I received the complaint.

00:46:26.640 --> 00:46:28.670
Idiot Cheoljong?

00:46:29.570 --> 00:46:31.640
What the queen did

00:46:31.640 --> 00:46:34.650
was not wasted.

00:46:37.550 --> 00:46:41.420
I must teach the Queen Mother a lesson.

00:46:41.950 --> 00:46:44.960
I'll show her who's boss in this palace.

00:46:50.960 --> 00:46:53.000
Are these all the palanquin bearers?

00:46:53.830 --> 00:46:54.830
Just...

00:46:54.830 --> 00:46:56.630
Choose again. Make sure they are funny.

00:46:56.630 --> 00:46:58.900
Yes, Your Majesty. Funny.

00:46:59.570 --> 00:47:01.210
What?

00:47:03.810 --> 00:47:06.210
Let them be tall and have a good figure.

00:47:06.210 --> 00:47:08.180
The stump is clear, and the young ones.

00:47:11.250 --> 00:47:14.590
Do you really choose porters?

00:47:14.790 --> 00:47:17.790
I choose not just palanquin bearers.

00:47:18.060 --> 00:47:20.060
You'll be amazed when you understand.

00:47:21.730 --> 00:47:24.190
I choose...

00:47:32.640 --> 00:47:35.740
-By the way. Have you heard the gossip?
-Which?

00:47:35.740 --> 00:47:38.340
The Queen did not try to kill herself.

00:47:38.340 --> 00:47:40.940
She wanted to save the king and his concubine.

00:47:43.210 --> 00:47:45.380
I wanted to save the king and his concubine,

00:47:45.380 --> 00:47:47.720
That’s why she lied and said it was suicide.

00:47:47.720 --> 00:47:49.150
Hot!

00:47:49.150 --> 00:47:50.890
-Family...
-Or a husband.

00:47:50.890 --> 00:47:52.620
-That's what...
-Question.

00:47:52.620 --> 00:47:56.160
And as a result, she lost the trust of the dowager queen.

00:47:56.160 --> 00:47:59.260
And she puts a silver knife to her neck and says:

00:47:59.260 --> 00:48:02.030
"I will escape from this unfortunate fate,

00:48:02.030 --> 00:48:04.170
where I can’t pick sides.”

00:48:05.470 --> 00:48:07.510
That's what she said.

00:48:07.510 --> 00:48:09.540
She was a witch.

00:48:09.540 --> 00:48:12.910
Rumor has it that she visited heaven.

00:48:13.640 --> 00:48:15.710
Because she fell into the lake?

00:48:15.850 --> 00:48:19.920
And how I met the Jade Emperor,
turned into a fairy.

00:48:27.020 --> 00:48:29.090
Excellent.

00:48:29.090 --> 00:48:31.630
I don't just choose porters,

00:48:31.630 --> 00:48:33.100
I choose storytellers.

00:48:33.100 --> 00:48:37.300
Living tabloids that
rumors will spread like an infection.

00:48:37.740 --> 00:48:39.040
What?

00:48:39.040 --> 00:48:42.340
When rumors start to spread
it turns into an infection.

00:48:42.340 --> 00:48:45.510
They scatter so much that even the one who started it all
unable to stop it.

00:48:45.510 --> 00:48:48.550
Moreover, they spread in unexpected ways.

00:48:48.550 --> 00:48:50.480
If she didn't try to commit suicide,

00:48:50.480 --> 00:48:54.080
means the one who pushed her into the lake...

00:48:55.150 --> 00:48:58.160
That is, the queen risked her life to

00:48:58.160 --> 00:49:00.520
save the concubine who tried to kill her?

00:49:01.730 --> 00:49:03.590
Mommies.

00:49:07.970 --> 00:49:10.100
Somehow I suddenly felt chills.

00:49:11.340 --> 00:49:13.970
It's time for you to rest.

00:49:14.210 --> 00:49:16.210
It won't work that way. I'll carry you if I have to.

00:49:16.210 --> 00:49:18.880
Come on. Okay, okay.

00:49:18.880 --> 00:49:22.010
Court Lady Choi doesn't nag at me, so now you do.

00:49:22.010 --> 00:49:24.580
Some kind of law of conservation of grumbling, or what?

00:49:25.780 --> 00:49:29.320
By the way, I haven’t seen her for a long time.

00:49:29.390 --> 00:49:31.520
What an oaf.

00:49:33.020 --> 00:49:35.860
Can you hug me tighter? Cold.

00:50:12.000 --> 00:50:15.730
Your Majesty!

00:50:15.730 --> 00:50:18.340
How could you harm yourself?

00:50:18.340 --> 00:50:21.770
Do you want me to go crazy?

00:50:21.770 --> 00:50:25.280
How could you arrange a swim with the king?

00:50:25.280 --> 00:50:28.410
Do you want to put the country in a dangerous situation?

00:50:28.410 --> 00:50:30.480
Mascot? Ritual?

00:50:30.480 --> 00:50:33.920
You shouldn't get involved in such prejudices.

00:50:33.920 --> 00:50:37.820
And you can’t say that either.

00:50:37.820 --> 00:50:40.760
From first to last,

00:50:40.760 --> 00:50:45.730
none of this is possible!

00:50:56.110 --> 00:51:00.810
Somehow I didn’t feel any better after that.

00:51:00.810 --> 00:51:04.780
If I grumble at her, Her Majesty will be restless.

00:51:05.450 --> 00:51:09.750
If I don’t, then I’m restless.

00:51:10.320 --> 00:51:15.290
So what should I do?

00:51:21.600 --> 00:51:27.000
Your Majesty!

00:51:27.140 --> 00:51:30.040
-Have you heard rumors?
-Which?

00:51:30.040 --> 00:51:32.440
This is all they whisper about in the palace.

00:51:32.440 --> 00:51:35.250
They say the queen risked her life

00:51:35.250 --> 00:51:37.580
to save you who tried to kill her.

00:51:37.720 --> 00:51:39.620
Who could say that?

00:51:40.180 --> 00:51:42.220
And not the queen?

00:51:42.350 --> 00:51:44.890
Replaced rumors that she's the local witch

00:51:44.890 --> 00:51:47.220
that she is a Buddha, a fairy, a virtuous woman.

00:51:47.220 --> 00:51:50.360
She managed to change everyone's mood.

00:51:51.800 --> 00:51:56.170
Now they will start cursing you and
saying that you are immoral.

00:51:57.570 --> 00:52:00.700
She had this plan from the very beginning.

00:52:00.700 --> 00:52:04.180
She came to me in the Sononjong hall and threatened me.

00:52:04.180 --> 00:52:06.010
So that's why.

00:52:07.380 --> 00:52:09.980
I'll go to the king and tell him

00:52:09.980 --> 00:52:13.420
so that the queen could no longer deceive him.

00:52:13.820 --> 00:52:15.550
I'm not sure.

00:52:16.150 --> 00:52:20.120
Will he believe your words?

00:52:20.360 --> 00:52:23.460
The king will believe what I tell him.

00:52:23.460 --> 00:52:27.700
He rejected the request to depose the queen.

00:52:33.070 --> 00:52:35.810
The royal concubine has arrived.

00:52:40.340 --> 00:52:42.010
Hwajin.

00:52:43.450 --> 00:52:47.350
I was just about to see you,
we need to talk about something.

00:52:47.950 --> 00:52:50.450
About what?

00:52:50.450 --> 00:52:52.620
Today at the council

00:52:52.620 --> 00:52:55.890
I received a petition for the deposition of the queen.

00:52:57.060 --> 00:52:58.460
How's that?

00:52:58.460 --> 00:53:01.630
The Queen put herself in danger to save us

00:53:01.630 --> 00:53:04.370
I thought it was wrong to stay away.

00:53:04.600 --> 00:53:09.240
So I want to ask
the royal secretariat recall him.

00:53:09.270 --> 00:53:11.040
Do you mind?

00:53:11.480 --> 00:53:14.110
Do you want me to ask my father?

00:53:14.110 --> 00:53:18.350
He is highly respected and many follow him.

00:53:21.390 --> 00:53:23.490
Or is my request too difficult?

00:53:26.720 --> 00:53:28.060
Not at all.

00:53:28.060 --> 00:53:31.700
I'll notify my father myself.

00:53:32.260 --> 00:53:33.460
Thank you.

00:53:33.460 --> 00:53:35.130
Your Majesty.

00:53:35.130 --> 00:53:39.040
Coming here, I always wanted only one thing.

00:53:39.270 --> 00:53:42.210
To be your support, as in our first meeting.

00:53:42.210 --> 00:53:44.670
So that next to me you can

00:53:44.980 --> 00:53:48.010
forget all your fears.

00:53:49.610 --> 00:53:52.720
You are already a great comfort to me.

00:53:52.980 --> 00:53:56.120
However, we are still

00:53:56.820 --> 00:53:59.490
We haven't spent a single night together.

00:54:04.260 --> 00:54:06.630
It was my fault that you felt lonely.

00:54:06.960 --> 00:54:09.130
I understand everything, you were busy.

00:54:09.130 --> 00:54:11.270
The demon misled me.

00:54:11.800 --> 00:54:13.940
Wait for me in your chambers this night.

00:54:14.570 --> 00:54:17.340
But tomorrow night you had to

00:54:17.340 --> 00:54:19.310
to spend with Her Majesty.

00:54:19.680 --> 00:54:21.850
It's not your concern.

00:54:22.550 --> 00:54:24.980
Then I will visit the queen and cheer her up a little.

00:54:24.980 --> 00:54:27.120
And then I’ll immediately sit down to write to my father.

00:54:27.120 --> 00:54:29.050
That would be nice.

00:54:37.230 --> 00:54:39.530
Concubine Cho came to visit Her Majesty.

00:54:39.530 --> 00:54:41.700
My apologies, Her Majesty was unwell,

00:54:41.700 --> 00:54:43.800
so she drank a medicinal decoction

00:54:43.800 --> 00:54:46.070
and fell asleep.

00:54:46.700 --> 00:54:48.370
It's a shame.

00:54:48.410 --> 00:54:50.140
Well, I'll come another time.

00:55:02.890 --> 00:55:04.550
Have you come?

00:55:05.920 --> 00:55:08.690
You just slept like a baby...

00:55:14.100 --> 00:55:16.870
And they told me that you were not feeling well.

00:55:19.170 --> 00:55:21.810
I can’t boast of feeling well yet,

00:55:22.810 --> 00:55:25.940
however, I don’t regret anything. Joseon needed a hero.

00:55:26.610 --> 00:55:29.480
-Hero?
-Why are we standing at the door?

00:55:29.480 --> 00:55:31.350
Come on in.

00:55:40.760 --> 00:55:42.290
Leave us alone so we...

00:55:42.290 --> 00:55:45.700
So that we can talk in a calm atmosphere.

00:56:00.740 --> 00:56:02.650
Make yourself comfortable.

00:56:13.320 --> 00:56:15.590
Why are you sitting so far away?

00:56:16.160 --> 00:56:18.660
As if not native.

00:56:19.060 --> 00:56:20.900
You should move closer.

00:56:20.900 --> 00:56:22.630
I feel good here too.

00:56:24.030 --> 00:56:27.870
Then I'll sit closer.

00:56:27.870 --> 00:56:30.140
I appeared as a prince on a white horse and saved her.

00:56:30.140 --> 00:56:33.280
Finally her unkind look
filled with love and adoration.

00:56:36.410 --> 00:56:38.210
What? But why?

00:56:38.880 --> 00:56:40.150
Your look has changed.

00:56:40.150 --> 00:56:43.420
But why is he even colder than before?

00:56:43.890 --> 00:56:46.690
I'll ask my father to take the petition back.

00:56:47.420 --> 00:56:50.930
This way we'll be even.

00:56:52.330 --> 00:56:54.060
Thank you.

00:56:54.060 --> 00:56:58.470
You probably think that everything is going your way.

00:56:59.040 --> 00:57:00.640
What are you, not at all.

00:57:00.640 --> 00:57:02.710
I don't think anything works here at all.

00:57:02.710 --> 00:57:04.880
We decided to return the favor in this way

00:57:04.880 --> 00:57:06.840
His Majesty after all your lies?

00:57:06.840 --> 00:57:08.580
What are you talking about?

00:57:08.580 --> 00:57:12.050
I'm certainly not one of the most honest,
but I don’t stoop to lying.

00:57:12.380 --> 00:57:14.620
I knew that you would make a fool of yourself.

00:57:14.620 --> 00:57:17.190
What? I'm not building anything.

00:57:19.760 --> 00:57:21.790
I have already repeated it many times.

00:57:21.790 --> 00:57:25.500
The king doesn't interest me at all.

00:57:26.560 --> 00:57:28.230
Fine.

00:57:28.470 --> 00:57:31.270
This time I will believe.

00:57:32.840 --> 00:57:35.710
Maybe you can stay the night
to get even closer?

00:57:35.710 --> 00:57:37.140
Let's have a pajama party.

00:57:37.140 --> 00:57:40.180
That is, a party in your underwear.

00:57:40.180 --> 00:57:44.310
I will spend this night with His Majesty.

00:57:45.420 --> 00:57:47.050
How so?!

00:57:47.550 --> 00:57:49.350
And so you break your heart,

00:57:49.620 --> 00:57:52.490
So you also came to tell me this personally?

00:57:52.490 --> 00:57:55.960
Just like that straight to the forehead? Heartless?

00:57:56.690 --> 00:57:59.860
You're very upset about something
for someone who is not interested in the king.

00:57:59.860 --> 00:58:01.430
He doesn't interest me.

00:58:01.430 --> 00:58:04.170
But I didn’t say anything about you.

00:58:04.300 --> 00:58:07.400
So prove that your affection towards me is sincere.

00:58:07.400 --> 00:58:11.340
If your actions don't match your words again,

00:58:12.510 --> 00:58:15.480
blame yourself. You won't find it enough.

00:58:17.920 --> 00:58:21.320
Since you are so determined, I wash my hands.

00:58:22.490 --> 00:58:24.150
So be it.

00:58:24.250 --> 00:58:28.360
I surrender, my blessing to you.

00:58:28.530 --> 00:58:30.360
But you have no idea what you've lost.

00:58:30.360 --> 00:58:32.800
I didn’t notice happiness under my nose.

00:58:33.630 --> 00:58:35.270
I'll go.

00:58:46.180 --> 00:58:48.510
This is a tough nut to crack.

00:58:50.680 --> 00:58:53.150
What a cruel woman.

00:59:08.270 --> 00:59:13.070
15, 20...

00:59:18.040 --> 00:59:20.010
What do I owe?

00:59:21.550 --> 00:59:25.010
My heart is heavy, I am sad.

00:59:25.550 --> 00:59:28.090
I came here to heal my wounded heart.

00:59:28.090 --> 00:59:31.090
You've come to the wrong address.

00:59:31.090 --> 00:59:34.120
We sell a lot of things

00:59:34.120 --> 00:59:36.330
but we have no drugs.

00:59:36.330 --> 00:59:38.260
I ask you, we are closing.

00:59:38.260 --> 00:59:40.300
Come on, the exit is over there.

00:59:41.030 --> 00:59:43.370
-But I...
- Please.

00:59:45.370 --> 00:59:47.370
I would like that miraculous thing.

00:59:47.670 --> 00:59:49.310
What?

00:59:51.840 --> 00:59:54.710
The same one that was brought from the Qing.

01:00:34.990 --> 01:00:38.390
I called you to discuss the topic,

01:00:38.390 --> 01:00:40.820
that was raised at today's meeting.

01:00:41.120 --> 01:00:43.430
Dare to secretly discuss the deposition of the queen?

01:00:43.430 --> 01:00:46.360
By doing this you insult the entire family of Kims from Andon!

01:00:46.360 --> 01:00:48.530
In the courtyard where the queen is

01:00:48.530 --> 01:00:51.100
can decide to drown himself at any moment,

01:00:51.100 --> 01:00:53.740
there will be no stability!

01:00:54.570 --> 01:00:56.840
How dare you speak ill of Her Majesty?

01:00:56.970 --> 01:00:59.440
You only know how to spit poison!

01:00:59.440 --> 01:01:01.410
Spit poison?

01:01:01.880 --> 01:01:06.450
I will not tolerate such an insult.

01:01:17.360 --> 01:01:19.400
What kind of business is this?

01:01:19.400 --> 01:01:21.600
Are you planning something wrong?

01:01:28.810 --> 01:01:32.040
What are you, I just ask you to listen to the end.

01:01:32.040 --> 01:01:33.710
Shelmets.

01:01:46.020 --> 01:01:49.630
As I said, no one
nothing is lost from you.

01:01:49.660 --> 01:01:53.300
Why not stay longer
and not listen to the end?

01:01:56.700 --> 01:01:58.430
Have a seat.

01:02:14.180 --> 01:02:17.150
I don't know if you remember.

01:02:17.150 --> 01:02:21.560
A letter that the Queen Mother wrote.

01:02:21.560 --> 01:02:25.000
The place, date and time indicated therein,

01:02:25.000 --> 01:02:28.430
coincide with when and where
there was an accident with the queen.

01:02:28.930 --> 01:02:31.070
The letter was falsified.

01:02:31.070 --> 01:02:34.000
But can you prove it?

01:02:38.480 --> 01:02:41.180
I suggest you come to your senses and not overthrow the queen,

01:02:42.350 --> 01:02:45.450
in return you will receive this message.

01:02:45.720 --> 01:02:48.150
Thus to your families

01:02:48.150 --> 01:02:50.920
no longer have to fear the consequences.

01:02:50.920 --> 01:02:53.720
This is my proposal.

01:02:55.930 --> 01:02:57.760
How do you like it?

01:03:16.610 --> 01:03:18.310
Did you call?

01:03:19.080 --> 01:03:22.420
I fulfilled His Majesty's request
and wrote to my father.

01:03:22.850 --> 01:03:25.790
Will you deliver my message to him?

01:03:28.360 --> 01:03:29.960
I'll try

01:03:30.460 --> 01:03:32.300
convince His Majesty.

01:03:32.300 --> 01:03:36.800
His Majesty just wants
repay good for good.

01:03:37.200 --> 01:03:39.800
Although Her Majesty has a different opinion on this matter.

01:03:40.470 --> 01:03:44.510
But I only care about His Majesty's feelings.

01:03:46.940 --> 01:03:48.880
Therefore everything is in order.

01:03:49.810 --> 01:03:53.720
Your Highness, everything is ready for swimming.

01:04:17.970 --> 01:04:21.940
So far so good.

01:04:30.120 --> 01:04:31.920
Your Majesty.

01:04:31.990 --> 01:04:34.320
Are you doing well?

01:04:34.320 --> 01:04:38.760
Would I call you if everything was fine with me?

01:04:40.630 --> 01:04:45.270
My heart is anxious and restless.

01:04:46.470 --> 01:04:48.500
Calm down.

01:04:49.010 --> 01:04:52.210
I will help you find the answer to your question.

01:05:16.700 --> 01:05:19.770
His Majesty was just going to see Concubine Cho.

01:05:19.770 --> 01:05:21.870
I have a conversation with him.

01:05:22.310 --> 01:05:24.510
Leave us alone.

01:05:25.610 --> 01:05:27.280
Yes, Your Majesty.

01:05:35.050 --> 01:05:37.250
The deposition of the queen will help accomplish the plan.

01:05:37.250 --> 01:05:40.060
So why are you so opposed to this?

01:05:40.060 --> 01:05:41.590
One queen will be deposed

01:05:41.590 --> 01:05:44.130
another will immediately take its place.

01:05:44.360 --> 01:05:47.300
So far, the queen’s actions do not interfere with us, but on the contrary.

01:05:47.300 --> 01:05:49.170
She's the best option

01:05:49.170 --> 01:05:51.600
of all possible.

01:05:52.570 --> 01:05:54.570
Did she touch your heart?

01:05:59.210 --> 01:06:01.980
Answer. Is that why you hesitate?

01:06:02.250 --> 01:06:03.910
Yes.

01:06:04.350 --> 01:06:06.220
Touched me.

01:06:06.720 --> 01:06:09.990
I made an attempt on her life
she wanted to sacrifice hers,

01:06:09.990 --> 01:06:12.460
to save me and the one I love.

01:06:12.460 --> 01:06:13.720
Not out of compassion

01:06:13.720 --> 01:06:14.990
and not because I forgave,

01:06:14.990 --> 01:06:17.890
but because he can't
put up with injustice.

01:06:17.890 --> 01:06:21.000
She doesn't expect an apology or gratitude from me.

01:06:21.000 --> 01:06:23.670
He simply acts according to his conscience.

01:06:23.670 --> 01:06:26.040
Now everyone has turned their backs on her.

01:06:26.670 --> 01:06:29.570
Can I do the same?

01:06:29.970 --> 01:06:32.510
It turns out that you will renounce us

01:06:34.580 --> 01:06:37.150
and from your concubine?

01:06:39.180 --> 01:06:41.920
I feel nothing for Her Majesty.

01:06:42.120 --> 01:06:44.420
But she is not our enemy.

01:06:44.420 --> 01:06:47.560
I do not renounce you or betray you.

01:06:47.560 --> 01:06:50.330
It will be bad if you have feelings for her.

01:06:50.330 --> 01:06:52.260
Having become attached to her,

01:06:52.260 --> 01:06:54.760
you will put us all at risk.

01:06:54.760 --> 01:06:57.130
I will try to prevent this from happening.

01:06:57.400 --> 01:06:59.200
Fine.

01:06:59.700 --> 01:07:02.070
Then promise me this.

01:07:02.240 --> 01:07:05.140
Promise that if the queen

01:07:05.140 --> 01:07:09.110
will interfere with our plans

01:07:09.850 --> 01:07:12.010
or behave strangely,

01:07:13.250 --> 01:07:15.150
you without hesitation

01:07:17.420 --> 01:07:19.660
order her to be killed.

01:07:44.510 --> 01:07:46.580
Why don't you answer?

01:07:46.580 --> 01:07:48.620
If the queen

01:07:49.890 --> 01:07:52.960
suddenly begins to interfere with our plans,

01:07:56.960 --> 01:08:00.930
I will personally behead her.

01:08:14.310 --> 01:08:17.550
Wow, I'm getting better and better every time.

01:08:20.680 --> 01:08:22.320
Did you really embroider this yourself?

01:08:22.320 --> 01:08:24.490
That's right, flowers. Is there any in Joseon?

01:08:24.490 --> 01:08:26.460
someone who doesn't know how to embroider?

01:08:26.460 --> 01:08:28.220
Descendants of the land of morning freshness

01:08:28.220 --> 01:08:29.860
I see there is.

01:08:30.890 --> 01:08:34.400
And not everyone should be able to embroider.

01:08:34.830 --> 01:08:37.500
Hardy, you can also do everything in the world.

01:08:37.500 --> 01:08:41.170
What are you talking about, I am the worst of the court ladies.

01:08:41.370 --> 01:08:45.010
Everyone says I'm like a violet.

01:08:45.840 --> 01:08:49.880
Yeah, everyone here is so handy.

01:08:49.950 --> 01:08:51.750
Well, let's look at our creativity.

01:08:52.780 --> 01:08:54.420
Straighten it out.

01:08:58.190 --> 01:09:01.460
Descendants of the land of morning freshness
Delivery opening

01:09:01.620 --> 01:09:04.390
We'll post this in front of the stables.

01:09:04.390 --> 01:09:07.030
I feel like things are going to be great for us.

01:09:07.760 --> 01:09:08.870
How much should I take?

01:09:08.870 --> 01:09:11.170
To get to Octajeon, you need money.

01:09:11.170 --> 01:09:12.800
Your Majesty.

01:09:14.200 --> 01:09:17.040
I brought you a flower. Rare orchid of the winds.

01:09:17.040 --> 01:09:18.740
Orchid of the winds?

01:09:19.710 --> 01:09:21.950
Has there already been word of mouth about our delivery?

01:09:21.950 --> 01:09:24.410
From whom are the flowers?

01:09:26.150 --> 01:09:28.350
Social distancing but congratulations

01:09:28.550 --> 01:09:31.920
From His Majesty.

01:09:35.690 --> 01:09:37.930
Why are you?

01:09:38.090 --> 01:09:39.760
What a bastard.

01:09:39.760 --> 01:09:42.370
I’m trying to forget myself here, I’m immersed in work.

01:09:42.370 --> 01:09:44.530
What is this one doing? What kind of show is this?

01:09:45.870 --> 01:09:47.870
Yes, I'm a thousand times cooler.

01:09:47.870 --> 01:09:50.070
Judge for yourself. That's what I came up with!

01:09:50.070 --> 01:09:52.180
I create jobs. What is he?

01:09:52.180 --> 01:09:55.140
And all this at a time when there are no 24-hour services.

01:09:55.210 --> 01:09:57.810
Yes, I'm a genius, a genius.

01:10:00.080 --> 01:10:02.690
Am I scaring her off with my coolness?

01:10:02.850 --> 01:10:05.290
Well, yes, I understand.

01:10:05.360 --> 01:10:07.160
Oh well.

01:10:08.020 --> 01:10:11.060
It's because of outrageous speeches

01:10:11.060 --> 01:10:15.970
turns out to be one nasty thing?
Why doesn't anything good come of it?

01:10:16.330 --> 01:10:18.230
Stand.

01:10:19.600 --> 01:10:22.400
Since the people here are dark and there are no amenities,

01:10:22.610 --> 01:10:25.280
I can go down in Joseon history with my ideas!

01:10:25.280 --> 01:10:28.680
No, global!

01:11:03.680 --> 01:11:06.680
I was really motivated.

01:11:06.820 --> 01:11:09.520
Can I become a local?
Steve Jobs or Thomas Edison?

01:11:09.520 --> 01:11:13.320
No, I'm taking it low. We need someone great.

01:11:13.320 --> 01:11:16.860
Savior of the human race.

01:11:28.970 --> 01:11:31.570
In the queen's body sits something

01:11:32.680 --> 01:11:36.380
that shouldn't be there.

01:11:36.980 --> 01:11:38.980
Evil spirit.

01:11:40.550 --> 01:11:45.020
The Queen is possessed by an evil spirit!

01:11:47.560 --> 01:11:50.430
We need to exorcise this spirit!

01:11:51.490 --> 01:11:53.560
Otherwise the whole world...

01:11:54.830 --> 01:12:00.570
The whole world will turn upside down!

01:12:03.940 --> 01:12:05.570
Exactly, Carrier!

01:12:05.640 --> 01:12:07.810
Inventor of air conditioners!

01:12:14.220 --> 01:12:15.250
Your Majesty!

01:12:15.250 --> 01:12:17.690
Come to your senses, Your Majesty! Come on.

01:12:17.690 --> 01:12:19.290
Your Majesty!

01:12:19.360 --> 01:12:21.560
Move away!

01:12:26.860 --> 01:12:29.470
She... She's not breathing.

01:12:36.810 --> 01:12:38.740
And I don’t feel any pulsations.

01:13:13.440 --> 01:13:15.680
The Queen is now unconscious.

01:13:15.680 --> 01:13:17.650
You say the queen is lying lifeless?

01:13:17.650 --> 01:13:20.480
To save her, you need to run
flow of male energy qi. Otherwise...

01:13:20.480 --> 01:13:22.620
Hospital? Am I back?

01:13:22.620 --> 01:13:24.520
I'll show you that the king

01:13:24.520 --> 01:13:26.420
is what it really is.

01:13:26.420 --> 01:13:30.760
This man is two-faced to the core.

01:13:30.760 --> 01:13:32.860
Move away. Discharge!

01:13:35.030 --> 01:13:38.200
-Queen.
-I order you to find out the truth.

01:13:38.200 --> 01:13:39.840
Not a step further.

01:13:39.840 --> 01:13:41.970
This is my woman.
